---
Inspect Marketing Measurement methodologies, LTV, and signals

Usage: vendo measurement [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  methodologies  List measurement methodologies
  rules          Methodology segmentation rules
  ltv            Cohort lifetime-value views
  signals        Measurement signal availability

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

Global options:
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics
